  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 513.53 Street Rod Plate.\n\n(a) Street rod plates shall be issued to vehicles described in RSA 259:106-a.\n\n(b) Street rod plates shall:\n\n(1) Have the words \"STREET ROD\"; and\n\n(2) Have a numeral from one to 999.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; renumbered by #12914 (formerly Saf-C 514.52); ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 514.52)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
